## **Step 1: Carve the Foundation (Solution & Projects)**
Run these incantations:

```bash
dotnet new sln -n DragonHoard
mkdir src && cd src

dotnet new classlib -n DragonHoard.Core
dotnet new classlib -n DragonHoard.Application
dotnet new classlib -n DragonHoard.Infrastructure
dotnet new classlib -n DragonHoard.Common
dotnet new webapi -n DragonHoard.API

# Add projects to solution
cd ..
dotnet sln add src/DragonHoard.Core
dotnet sln add src/DragonHoard.Application
dotnet sln add src/DragonHoard.Infrastructure
dotnet sln add src/DragonHoard.Common
dotnet sln add src/DragonHoard.API

# Wire references
cd src/DragonHoard.Application && dotnet add reference ../DragonHoard.Core
dotnet add reference ../DragonHoard.Common

cd ../DragonHoard.Infrastructure && dotnet add reference ../DragonHoard.Application
dotnet add reference ../DragonHoard.Core
dotnet add reference ../DragonHoard.Common

cd ../DragonHoard.API && dotnet add reference ../DragonHoard.Application
dotnet add reference ../DragonHoard.Infrastructure
dotnet add reference ../DragonHoard.Core
dotnet add reference ../DragonHoard.Common
```

