## ✅ **Update Program.cs**
Replace the old Pip-only code with:

```csharp
using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Mvc;
using KoboldBrain.Services;

var builder = WebApplication.CreateBuilder(args);
builder.Services.AddSingleton<KoboldClan>();

var app = builder.Build();

app.MapPost("/ask", ([FromBody] Question question, KoboldClan clan) =>
{
    var response = clan.Ask(question.Text);
    return Results.Ok(new { response });
});

app.Run();

record Question(string Text);
```

